> @j20001970, find the trace in attached file : [trace.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28434546/trace.log)

The audio driver setup process seems working as expected from the look of PipeWire trace log, but crashed soon after a few `pw_thread_loop_lock/unlock`s. I guess the crash come from output stream `process` event, but I'm not yet certain which part caused that.

@Chlipouni can you try reproducing the crash again, with `debug_symbols=yes` this time when building Godot? The Godot crash backtrace alone should be good for locating the problem, thanks!
